  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Glossary'>
      <repository-location id='Glossary' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/LSOOS-HungaryCaseStudy' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='300' maxwidth='1000' minheight='300' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='94666' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='2667'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Glossary:</run>
              <run>

GBV Total Failed Loss = GBV of all orders failed
GBV Failed by Vendor Loss = GBV of orders failed by vendor
GBV Failed OOS Loss = GBV of orders failed by vendor OOS
GBV PF Loss = GBV of items partially fulfilled
GBV Total OOS Loss (FR+PF) = GBV of orders failed by vendor OOS + items partially fulfilled

Not Found + Reduced GBV Loss = GBV of items not found + fulfilled with reduced quantity. Considers </run>
              <run bold='true'>only sent </run>
              <run>orders.

Rates: KPIs from above as % of GBV Delivered. Can be more than 100%

</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
